  "title": "26 June 1963: Live: Majestic Ballroom, Newcastle",
  "date": "1963-06-26",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>The Beatles’ second and final concert at Newcastle’s Majestic Ballroom took place on 26 June 1963. They had previously appeared at the venue on <a href=\"/1963/01/28/live-majestic-ballroom-newcastle/\">28 January 1963</a>.</p><p>This was the group’s final appearance in a ballroom run by Top Rank, although they continued to perform in cinemas and theatres operated by the company.</p><p>Before the show, in a room at the Turk’s Hotel in Newcastle, <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a> and <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> began writing their next single, <a href=\"/songs/she-loves-you/\">‘She Loves You’</a>.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/06/26/live-majestic-ballroom-newcastle-2/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-3818 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/uk_she-loves-you/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_she-loves-you-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"She Loves You single - United Kingdom\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_she-loves-you-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_she-loves-you-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_she-loves-you.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10205\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/uk_she-loves-you/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_she-loves-you.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"500,500\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"She Loves You single – United Kingdom\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_she-loves-you.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/sweden_she_loves_you/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_she_loves_you-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"She Loves You single artwork - Sweden\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_she_loves_you-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_she_loves_you-577x580.jpg 577w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_she_loves_you-955x960.jpg 955w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_she_loves_you-768x772.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_she_loves_you-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_she_loves_you.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10147\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/sweden_she_loves_you/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_she_loves_you.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,1005\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"She Loves You single artwork – Sweden\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_she_loves_you-955x960.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/usa_she_loves_you/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_she_loves_you-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"She Loves You single artwork - USA\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_she_loves_you-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/